{"id":"b3daf6b72ffe4cb5","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-top7-countably-compact-space.md","title":"ZFC Top7 Countably Compact Space","display":"df-zfc-top7-countably-compact-space — ZFC Top7 Countably Compact Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top7-countably-compact-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top7-countably-compact-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top7-countably-compact-space — ZFC Top7 Countably Compact Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top7-countably-compact-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top7-countably-compact-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top7-countably-compact-space — ZFC Top7 Countably Compact Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set\">58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set\">58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3a78929818a246ba\" href=\"?note=3a78929818a246ba\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union\">58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> are the registered countability and finiteness predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7CountablyCompactSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop7CountablyCompactSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}countably\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7CountablyCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\;\n\\Bigl(\n(\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(\\mathcal U)\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal V\\;\n(\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal V)\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal V)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}countably\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7CountablyCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\;\n\\Bigl(\n(\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(\\mathcal U)\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal V\\;\n(\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal V)\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal V)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Only countable open covers are quantified, and the finite subcover condition uses the registered cardinal predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3aa1f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union","status":"resolved","id":"3a78929818a246ba","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086